### Japanese machine translation of `../en/zones.ftl` (2026-11-01), a baseline for a translator to
### correct. The English file says which part of which place each name is; `$place` is the game's
### own name for the place, read from the ROM. A name missing here is said in English.

part-0x2e = { $place }北部
part-0x2f = { $place }南部
part-0x30 = { $place }
part-0x31 = { $place }高台
part-0xdb = { $place }北西
part-0xdc = { $place }北東
part-0xdd = { $place }南西
part-0xde = { $place }南東
part-0x1dd = { $place }北西のきのみ畑
part-0x211 = { $place }北東のきのみ畑
part-0x212 = { $place }南西のきのみ畑
part-0x213 = { $place }南東のきのみ畑
